Package: doorman
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: doorman contributors
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, libc6, libgcc-s1, libpam0g, systemd, ffmpeg, v4l-utils
Recommends: gtklock, pamtester, swaylock
Homepage: https://github.com/doorman/doorman
Description: Face authentication daemon and PAM module
 doorman provides a local face-authentication daemon, management CLI, and PAM
 module for Linux login, unlock, and sudo flows. The package installs the
 daemon, CLI, PAM module, systemd units, and default configuration, but never
 edits /etc/pam.d automatically.
